From 19e6d7e44fb5b003c758584cec4ce1e91c56cdf0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 17:58:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: complete Phase B - de-inline the 3 SDN/MLO
 SPA-bundle CSS

Revert rwd_component.css, sdn.css, mlo.css to pristine base a7ebfa133a and
relocate their recolors into reaper_content.css sections 17-19 (mechanically
extracted real-selector !important rules = the exact on-device-validated bundle
hex-swap). The httpd filter injects reaper_content.css into sdn.html/mlo.html
after their base bundle links; the runtime theme-variant CSS is gated on
current_theme in {WHITE,ROG,TUF} and never loads on the BE96U default theme, so
the injected rules win. All 7 stock CSS files are now pristine.

NOT yet built - validate the SDN/MLO SPA on the next flash.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
