+/* ---------- 17-19. SDN/MLO SPA bundle migration (2026-07-05) ----------
+   Recolors relocated from the now-pristine SPA bundle files (RWD_UI/
+   rwd_component.css, SDN/sdn.css, SDN/mlo.css). The httpd serve-time filter
+   injects this stylesheet into sdn.html/mlo.html AFTER their base bundle links
+   (before </head>), so these !important rules win. The runtime theme-variant
+   injection (rwd_component_<theme>.css / sdn_<theme>.css) is gated on
+   current_theme in {WHITE,ROG,TUF}; RT-BE96U runs the default (empty) theme, so
+   no variant CSS loads to override this. Selectors+values are the exact reaper
+   hex-swap that was on-device-validated as the bundle edit; supersedes the
+   section-13 backstop for the SPA. VALIDATE ON DEVICE after the next flash. */
